  "payload": {
    "rawResponseText": "For an **existing mid-size upper-upscale hotel in Mexico**, the most practical conversion candidates from the results are **IHG’s voco hotels**, **Marriott’s Sheraton/Westin/Le Méridien/Delta**, **Hilton’s DoubleTree**, **Hyatt Regency or Hyatt Centric**, and **Wyndham’s Wyndham Grand or upper-upscale soft-brand options** like **Registry Collection Hotels** where the asset is distinctive enough.[4][7][10][12][17]\n\nWhy these are the best fits:\n- **voco hotels** is explicitly being used for hotel conversions in Mexico, and IHG says the brand is intended to help owners “elevate their existing properties” and “optimize returns.”[4][6]\n- IHG also has strong Mexico momentum across premium and luxury/lifestyle brands, including **InterContinental, Kimpton, Hotel Indigo, Crowne Plaza, voco, and EVEN**, which gives owners multiple positioning options depending on the asset and market.[3][10][17]\n- **Marriott** has recently expanded in Mexico with **Aloft, Sheraton, and Delta**, which makes its upscale and upper-upscale flags relevant for conversion discussions.[7]\n- **Hilton**’s **DoubleTree** is repeatedly listed as an upper-upscale brand and is commonly positioned for business and leisure demand.[8][10][17]\n- **Hyatt Regency** and **Hyatt Centric** appear in the upper-upscale / contemporary upscale space and are cited as suitable for hotels seeking a more lifestyle-forward or premium business-leisure mix.[10][17]\n- **Wyndham** has upper-upscale positioning for **Wyndham Grand** and also participates in Mexico through broader expansion, while **Registry Collection Hotels** can suit higher-end, distinctive assets.[10][12]\n\nIf you want the **shortlist by conversion friendliness**, it would be:\n- **voco**\n- **DoubleTree**\n- **Delta**\n- **Sheraton**\n- **Hyatt Centric**\n- **Hyatt Regency**\n- **Westin**\n- **Le Méridien**\n\nIf you want, I can also narrow this to the **best brand by city type** in Mexico, such as **Mexico City, Cancún, Guadalajara, Monterrey, or resort markets**.",
